WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:04.234
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."
You made it. You're here.

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:06.501
Thank you for watching.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:08.868
I'm former "Jimmy Kimmel Live!"
host, Jimmy Fallon.

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:10.901
Nice to see you.

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.400
Well, guys, this was exciting.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.834
Last night was the
64th Annual Grammy Awards.

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:17.501
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:20.234
And I think it was
a good night overall,

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:22.601
because nobody's watching
the uncensored Japanese version

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.734
on Twitter,
and that's a good thing.

00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:29.901
That's right --
it was the 64th Grammy Awards,

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:32.901
which means it's been 64 years
of parents watching like,

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:34.534
"Who leaves the house
dressed like that?

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.000
You don't dress like..."

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.267
Yeah, it was a fun night.

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:40.000
Hours and hours of musicians
performing for free

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.067
or, as that's also known,
Spotify.

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:43.701
Hey!

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.434
Trevor, you could have
had that one.

00:00:46.434 --> 00:00:48.434
-Yeah.
-Let's switch gears.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:50.100
I saw that Sarah Palin
has announced

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.200
that she is running
for Congress in Alaska,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.400
which is --
[ Audience groans ]

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.133
Which is good news
for Republicans

00:00:58.133 --> 00:01:00.467
and great news for Democrats.

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:03.801
You know, for someone who could
see Russia from her house,

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:05.801
she should have known years ago
what Putin was up to,

00:01:05.801 --> 00:01:07.167
don't you think?

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.701
Well, I read that thanks to
the ongoing bird-flu outbreak,

00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:13.601
the cost of eggs is surging

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:15.801
in grocery stores
across the country.

00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:16.901
You'll know things are bad when

00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:19.901
kids spend
Easter dyeing eggbeaters.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.501
And that's not the only problem
the bird flu is causing.

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:28.100
Apparently, Costco is facing
supply shortages

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.267
of its rotisserie chickens.

00:01:30.267 --> 00:01:32.934
And now I'm wondering,
what came first?

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:35.167
The chicken shortage
or the egg shortage?

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:37.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.868
I missed you guys. I really did.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:44.234
I missed you.

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.300
Thank you.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.400
Well, that's right --

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:49.801
Costco is running low,
which means

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:52.868
they're down to roughly
10 billion rotisserie chickens.

00:01:52.868 --> 00:01:54.133
They give you one on the way in.

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:55.167
You're like,
"Oh, I don't even want --"

00:01:55.167 --> 00:01:57.267
"Just take three. Just --"
"Okay."

00:01:57.267 --> 00:01:59.367
Yeah, it turns out bird flu
has been spreading quickly

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:01.100
because some of
the chickens have been using

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.367
fake vaccine cards.

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:03.801
Isn't that unbelievable?

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.167
What?!

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:09.801
Yeah, get this -- a man in
Germany is in trouble

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:13.334
after he got
90 COVID vaccine shots

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:16.534
so that he could sell
forged vaccine cards.

00:02:16.534 --> 00:02:18.634
90 doses.

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:21.934
That guy could eat fried bat
for dinner and be fine.

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.601
And this is annoying.

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:29.033
Even after 90 doses,
the CDC says he'll probably need

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:31.267
another booster
in about four months.

00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:34.300
And, finally, a Supreme Court
justice in Sweden

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:38.367
has been fined after she was
caught shoplifting meatballs.

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:39.701
If she does it again,

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:41.467
she'll be sentenced to
six months living in an IKEA.

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:42.467
We have a great show, everybody.

